  "description": "Leona's Sunlight as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): the main pack's Sunlight makes enemies hit by her abilities take 10% more damage for 1.5 s, because data cannot tell who hits a marked enemy; with this add-on her abilities mark enemies for 2.5 s and an allied champion's attack or ability on a marked enemy detonates the mark for 32-151 magic damage by Leona's level (her own hits do not). Everything else stays the main pack's. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-14",
